# Loki Laufeyson: "Loki's power" is read when the spell is cast (CR 603.2), not when the ability was activated. Bot1
# activates Loki while it is a 2/1, then powers it up (two +1/+1 counters, a 4/3), then casts Mine Collapse by sacrificing a
# Mountain - mana value 4 whatever it cost (CR 118.9c, 202.3). 4 is no more than Loki's power now, so it is copied, and the
# copy is aimed at Bot2's Ornithopter: both it and the Llanowar Elves the original targets die.

